map.：某小区总用地 50000 m²，其中绿地 8000 m²、树冠投影 2000:
: A residential estate with a total site of 50000 m2, of which green space is 8000 m2, tree canopy projection 2000 m2 and resident population 2000:
green space ratio = 8000 / 50000 x 100% = 16%;
green coverage ratio = (8000 + 2000) / 50000 x 100% = 20%;
green space per capita = 8000 / 2000 = 4 m2 per person.
In this example the green space ratio of 16% falls short of the >=30% requirement for new residential areas, so more concentrated green space or sunken solutions are needed.
